Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.55,0:00:43.63,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}Become all the more precious to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:47.53,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}You showed me many new things,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.53,0:00:51.69,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}Crossing the fragmented moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.69,0:00:57.54,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}I want my feelings to join yours… to reach you…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:03.62,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I've heard she's quite the terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.00,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,If you stare into her eyes for more than three seconds...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:07.12,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,I've heard of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.50,0:01:09.79,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,Misfortunes come to haunt you in seven days, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:11.09,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,That's the rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.63,0:01:13.71,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,How terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:18.47,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Oh, and I heard that Yuka stared into her eyes and went down with a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.64,0:01:21.22,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,She has to be real!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:22.72,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:27.31,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,You dropped this...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.15,0:01:29.23,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.23,0:01:31.15,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You can keep it!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.07,0:01:36.99,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,For some reason, I always find people apologizing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.32,0:01:41.78,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I hear she can sense ghosts and even summon them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.58,0:01:45.29,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,And her name is also Sadako, like from The Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.29,0:01:48.37,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,You have to give it to her parents for\N giving her such an appropriate name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.13,0:01:57.93,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Feel free to use this stall. It's open now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:06.02,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for not living up to your\N expectations, but I can't see ghosts...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.43,0:02:10.23,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,And my name is Sawako, not Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.77,0:02:14.03,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnEraserDust\alpha&H20&\frx30\fry340\frz5\fs120\pos(725,200)}S
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.77,0:02:14.03,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnEraserDust\alpha&H20&\frx30\fry340\frz5\fs120\pos(725,275)}a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.77,0:02:14.03,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnEraserDust\alpha&H20&\frx30\fry340\frz5\fs120\pos(725,350)}w
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.77,0:02:14.03,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnEraserDust\alpha&H20&\frx30\fry340\frz5\fs120\pos(725,425)}a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.77,0:02:14.03,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnEraserDust\alpha&H20&\frx30\fry340\frz5\fs120\pos(725,520)}k
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.77,0:02:14.03,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnEraserDust\alpha&H20&\frx30\fry340\frz5\fs120\pos(725,595)}o
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:14.03,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,My name means "Lively Child".
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.03,0:02:19.03,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnCrayonAL\fs150\blur7\bord10\c&HFEF8FF&\3c&HE3BDFB&\pos(960,760)}prologue
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.32,0:02:26.12,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,For some reason, people are always afraid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.16,0:02:29.75,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I just want to be friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.75,0:02:32.88,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'll really try my best today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:37.67,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I heard that a lot of celebrities show up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.67,0:02:40.01,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Hirano-san... Endou-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:39.22,Default-alt,Girl2,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:40.38,Default-alt,Girl,0,0,0,,That's what I heard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:41.89,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.72,0:02:45.89,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I think I was able to greet them cheerfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.27,0:02:48.48,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:50.31,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,Oh, you walking to school?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:52.31,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's Kazehaya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:55.32,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:03:00.45,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,He's always at the center of attention,\Nnot to mention how cheerful and lively he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:02.45,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Morning, Kuronuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.24,0:03:05.66,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,What a kind soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.66,0:03:09.83,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I can't believe he'd greet me the same way he does others!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:11.17,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,G-Good m-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:12.92,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Yo, Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:13.71,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&}PLACEHOLDER
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:19.17,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Kazehaya-kun is the complete opposite of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.17,0:03:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&}PLACEHOLDER
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.88,0:03:22.97,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Everyone gathers around Kazehaya-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.97,0:03:25.22,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,and it's almost as if people form a circle around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:17.25,Default-alt,Guy,0,0,0,,Did you do your homework, Kazehaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.25,0:03:18.30,Default-alt,Kaze,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:19.63,Default-alt,Guy,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:21.34,Default-alt,Guy,0,0,0,,We're in the same boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:28.85,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,The day of our high school entrance ceremony...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:39.65,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,U-Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.45,0:03:45.95,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,If you're looking for Kitahoro High, it's that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:51.33,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:59.38,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,People are always apologizing to\N me, but he smiled and said "Thanks".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:06.35,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Since that day, I've aspired to be like Kazehaya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.93,0:04:11.85,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I hope that someday, I'll be able to act like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.02,0:04:17.94,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,And so, we're going to hold an event to test our\N courage on the day before the closing ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.40,0:04:20.28,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:26.49,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I'm going to put up this sign-up sheet on the\N board, so be sure to sign up if you want to attend.
