Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:26.32,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\fnBrianne's hand\fs50\frz345\c&H38393A&\pos(1500,735)}Participants\N 200 Yen Fee
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.32,0:04:28.16,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\fnBrianne's hand\fs50\frz345\c&H38393A&\pos(1515,740)}Participants\N 200 Yen Fee
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:28.16,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,It'd be great if everyone could make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:31.87,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,"Everyone"? That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.20,0:04:33.91,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I wonder if Sadako's coming, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.91,0:04:35.83,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I bet if she shows up, real ghosts would come along with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.79,0:04:39.71,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I-I can't live up to their expectations!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.71,0:04:43.72,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I wonder if people would be\N disappointed if I went, but no ghosts appeared...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.38,0:04:47.64,Default,Teach,0,0,0,,Well, you'll all be in summer\N vacation once the closing ceremony ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:50.56,Default,Teach,0,0,0,,Which means... summer classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:52.14,Default,All,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:57.56,Default,Teach,0,0,0,,I need a volunteer who'd be willing to take some time\N off from their summer to help me prepare for the classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:04:59.15,Default,Teach,0,0,0,,It won't be very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:01.69,Default,Teach,0,0,0,,If no one wants to volunteer, I'll just pick someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.61,0:05:06.07,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,N-No one wants to do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:08.20,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:11.70,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,If it's okay with you, I wouldn't mind doing it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.70,0:05:13.41,Default,Teach,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.41,0:05:14.91,Default,Teach,0,0,0,,Then I'll put your name down, Kuronuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.91,0:05:16.00,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:21.05,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Kuronuma's always getting stuck with jobs like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:24.55,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:31.89,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I don't think it's right to give her\N all the jobs people don't want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.22,0:05:34.60,Default,Teach,0,0,0,,Then would you like to take her place, Kazehaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:35.77,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.85,0:05:38.85,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,No choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.85,0:05:39.90,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I guess I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:42.57,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,He noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:45.11,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,That I've always been working?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.99,0:05:52.45,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.37,0:05:55.20,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Please, let me do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:06:00.21,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I don't really have anything\N planned for the summer, so I'll be bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:01.09,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Very bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:04.05,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I live close by, and I'll be really bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:05.59,Default-alt,Teach,0,0,0,,Well, if you insist...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.59,0:06:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&}PLACEHOLDER
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.34,0:06:09.01,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I can't believe he noticed...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.84,0:06:08.43,Default-alt,Guy,0,0,0,,That was close, Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:12.89,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Even things that were being done by a quiet girl like me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.31,0:06:17.23,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,What a nice person!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.35,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,That really made my day...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:21.94,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.73,0:06:23.90,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Shino-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:25.69,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,It's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.69,0:06:28.32,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're in different classes after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:30.07,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,How are you getting along with your classmates?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:32.20,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,There's no one from your old schools, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.20,0:06:34.12,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yeah. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:36.95,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Well... There's someone called Kazehaya-kun, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:38.96,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,Oh, that lively one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:40.88,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,"Lively" is an understatement!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:44.09,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'd say one hundred percent liveliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.09,0:06:49.30,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,No, it's actually more like he's made out of liveliness itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:56.22,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Kazehaya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.89,0:07:00.85,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,This is bad! He totally heard that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:01.94,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,You should apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.11,0:07:04.32,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:06.19,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.19,0:07:08.78,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I was complimenting him, but I guess they misunderstood me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.15,0:07:11.28,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Hey, what you said...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.61,0:07:14.28,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,How should I interpret that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.83,0:07:20.58,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,As...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:22.25,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,As a compliment!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:23.21,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:28.80,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.13,0:07:33.01,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I'll be over there in a second, so wait there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:36.72,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,We've never really had a chance to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.31,0:07:41.23,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,Aren't you happy, Sadako?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.23,0:07:45.06,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,I heard that Kazehaya-kun can't stand it when a student can't fit in with the rest of the class.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.94,0:07:47.11,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,I can rest easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:48.03,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:54.07,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,What an... What an amazing person Kazehaya-kun is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:58.08,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,He believed me when I told him what I really meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:01.54,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,He took my word for what it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:07.67,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:11.38,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I always thought you didn't like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:12.80,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,D-Dislike?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:15.26,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,N-No, you have it all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:20.31,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I've always dreamed of being lively like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:21.85,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Always...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.81,0:08:27.40,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,But seriously, I'm not as lively as you think I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:28.40,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:29.78,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,You really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:31.69,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Even your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:34.15,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Speak for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:36.41,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,"Sawako".
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.70,0:08:41.08,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Your name is Kuronuma Sawako, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.79,0:08:48.29,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,No one... ever calls me that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.17,0:08:54.34,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,This... may be the first time that I've\N been able to clear up a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.39,0:08:59.89,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,But you were able to speak your mind when you tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.27,0:09:05.31,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,He's... amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.31,0:09:10.19,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Amazing... this is the first time someone from school has called me by my name...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.73,0:09:12.48,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,And the first time anyone's made me feel this way...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.48,0:09:15.28,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,You'd better come to that event, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:17.70,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,The first time in my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.41,0:09:27.67,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I guess I'll go put my name in secret...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.83,0:09:30.46,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Huh? Sadako?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.79,0:09:31.55,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.55,0:09:35.09,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I bet the event will be so much\N better if someone were to play a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.09,0:09:40.01,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I'm sure Sadako will be able to\N scare people off just by standing there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:42.81,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:45.73,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,H-H-How long have you been standing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.73,0:09:47.81,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Umm... I was wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.48,0:09:50.36,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Could you let me be the ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:51.69,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.69,0:09:55.99,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,You don't need to force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:57.70,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,We'd feel kind of bad if you didn't actually want to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.99,0:10:04.45,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,But you were able to speak your mind when you tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.12,0:10:11.13,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I've... never done anything I didn't want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.25,0:10:18.34,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I've always just wanted to get along with everyone, but I\N haven't been doing those chores because I didn't want to do them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.01,0:10:22.60,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's just that it makes me happy if I could be of some use...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:30.27,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Also, I'm sorry I can't live up to everyone's expectations, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.27,0:10:31.19,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.73,0:10:33.11,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I can't summon ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.11,0:10:34.11,Default,Both,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.11,0:10:36.36,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I can't sense ghosts or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:38.36,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,You can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:39.20,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.61,0:10:40.53,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Not at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.53,0:10:41.49,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.29,0:10:48.29,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,And it took you {\i1}this{\i0\fscx40} {\r} long to admit that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.29,0:10:51.92,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,And what do you mean, "expectations"?! You're such an odd one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:53.92,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Seriously, that's so weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:55.09,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Don't you agree, Chizu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.09,0:10:58.01,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.01,0:11:02.34,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I'm a sucker for brave girls like her...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.89,0:11:04.93,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,You're weird, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:07.47,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,We're counting on you to put on\N the best ghost act of all time, Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.31,0:11:12.56,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I'll keep this a secret between the\N three of us, so go scare them as you please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:15.98,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.57,0:11:21.20,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I was able to get through to them...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:24.99,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Even if it was just a little bit, I feel like I was able to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:27.41,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Kazehaya-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:34.00,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1450,0)\blur0.5\fnAngelina\fs120\c&H4B6C82&\t(3860,5940,\c&H000000&)\alpha&H11&\pos(960,700)}Kuronuma Sawako
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:31.83,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,This is all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:37.80,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Every ten minutes, a new pair will head out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.17,0:11:40.22,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,Looks like almost everyone is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.22,0:11:42.05,Default,Guy3,0,0,0,,I guess Sadako is the only one who didn't show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:43.51,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Oh, Sadako is actually-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:46.05,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Didn't I say it was a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:01.28,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I want everyone to have a great time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:02.15,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.66,0:12:05.03,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,It's so dark...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.03,0:12:06.58,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,I'm actually starting to get scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.26,0:12:29.26,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,A ghost!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:33.56,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I think they liked it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.90,0:12:41.44,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,W-What are those screams?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:43.24,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.03,0:12:47.16,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:48.87,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.87,0:12:51.58,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm actually being useful to everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.29,0:12:55.21,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll hold a lock of my hair in my mouth next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.38,0:13:06.84,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Kuronuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:08.39,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Kazehaya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.39,0:13:10.35,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,W-What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.97,0:13:13.98,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,P-Playing a ghost for a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.98,0:13:15.44,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,What the heck...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:17.44,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,You should've told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:20.48,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I'm the coordinator for the time being, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:22.82,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I thought you weren't coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:29.53,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I didn't want to make you look less cool...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.53,0:13:30.49,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:32.20,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.25,0:13:35.91,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Aren't you scared being out here all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.91,0:13:38.92,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I enjoy the nighttime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.04,0:13:41.96,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Especially summer nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.59,0:13:45.22,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,The air... the scent...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:50.14,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,The sound of the wind rustling through the leaves... the insects...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.10,0:13:55.06,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.31,0:14:00.56,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,It feels pretty good out here. Can I stay here with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:01.61,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:04.03,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But... what about the event?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.03,0:14:09.91,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Because a certain someone didn't show up,\Nthere was an odd number of people, and I had to go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.94,0:14:11.33,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)}*no flashlights*  *SUCKS TO BE YOU!*  *go out there alone!!*
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.82,0:14:11.33,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1200,0)}*threesomes aren't allowed*   *no tagging along with another group*
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.53,0:14:11.33,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,It's scary out here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.83,0:14:19.33,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,What's happening right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:21.34,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:24.92,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yano-san! Yoshida-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:27.55,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Huh? What's Kazehaya doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:30.59,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,If you guys knew about this, you should've told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.59,0:14:33.85,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Oh my, aren't you a gentleman?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:36.18,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Lively guys are so amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:38.39,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Cut it out already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.39,0:14:39.64,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.98,0:14:42.90,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Looks like you've been doing a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.90,0:14:44.23,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Here, drink up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:48.70,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Thank you!
