Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:54.45,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Th-They're so kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:57.29,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Looks like you're beginning to open up to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.46,0:14:59.41,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:01.63,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Opening up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:03.63,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:09.01,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I-It's all thanks to you, Kazehaya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.59,0:15:12.05,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I haven't done a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.05,0:15:17.47,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,No, I wouldn't have been able to\N express my feelings if it weren't for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:21.19,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I took this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:25.32,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,You're actually pretty cheerful, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.15,0:15:27.98,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,You're really optimistic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.36,0:15:30.95,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Cheerful? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.66,0:15:35.33,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,That's the first time anyone's ever said that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.12,0:15:39.50,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Don't stare at me for so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.37,0:15:42.29,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I-I-I-I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.29,0:15:44.04,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I got too carried away...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.04,0:15:48.00,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'll try not to stare into your eyes for more than three seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.00,0:15:51.76,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But the thing is, it really won't cause misfortune or anything-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.76,0:15:51.76,Default-alt,Kaze,0,0,0,,That's not what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:53.68,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,It's embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.51,0:15:55.80,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Don't make me say it, geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.81,0:16:07.52,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,He suddenly stopped talking, so I don't really know what to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:10.74,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It feels like my heart is a complete mess...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.65,0:16:13.86,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's like I was reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:16.12,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,So many new feelings that I've never experienced before...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:21.79,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It seems like Kazehaya-kun is introducing me to many new things...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:26.00,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm... so glad I was able to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:28.30,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.30,0:16:29.63,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Summer break!
