Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:32.84,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,Well then, let's announce the results of\Nthe test of courage before we head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.13,0:16:36.55,Default,Guy3,0,0,0,,First of all, Kazehaya, you're getting a penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:38.31,Default,Guy3,0,0,0,,You didn't even finish!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.01,0:16:40.47,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,You guys noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.47,0:16:41.64,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Tanaka, you came in first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:43.85,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Your prize are sixty scrubbing brushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.85,0:16:45.15,Default,Tanaka,0,0,0,,What kind of a prize is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.15,0:16:50.11,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,And Kazehaya, your penalty for not finishing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.86,0:16:54.82,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,...you get to date Sadako-chan for a week!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.66,0:16:57.57,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,W-What did he just say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:03.00,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I heard you were with Sadako last night, Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:05.29,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,I bet she was making a move on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.29,0:17:06.75,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You guys should totally hook up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.67,0:17:09.92,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You guys just crossed the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:12.51,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I'm willing to do anything {\i1}but{\i0\fscx40} {\r} that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.63,0:17:15.38,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Hey, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:19.14,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,That's awfully rude as a penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.51,0:17:21.77,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Kuronuma's a girl, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.77,0:17:23.02,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,This isn't even funny as a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.39,0:17:26.77,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Don't let this get to you, Kuronuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.81,0:17:29.77,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.77,0:17:32.53,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,You can't stand up for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.07,0:17:37.16,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Kazehaya-kun... your reputation will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:39.16,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.91,0:17:45.12,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,As you all say, I was indeed with Kazehaya-kun last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.41,0:17:47.42,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But that's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.63,0:17:51.13,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,...anything special like you all are thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.84,0:17:57.13,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It was only because Kazehaya-kun is willing to talk to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.88,0:17:59.26,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:03.31,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I know how to clear up a misunderstanding now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:10.81,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But it's true I was attracted to\N Kazehaya-kun's kindness, liveliness, cheerfulness...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.19,0:18:14.57,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,...and integrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.57,0:18:19.49,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,That's... how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.70,0:18:27.41,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,P-Please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.29,0:18:34.46,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:39.30,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm sure the misunderstanding was cleared up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.34,0:18:42.43,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I didn't tell a single lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.97,0:18:45.31,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I only told the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.72,0:18:48.44,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm sure I was able to protect Kazehaya-kun's reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.56,0:18:54.52,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,What? Even though it's summer vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.52,0:18:57.61,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yeah. I need to help out my teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.45,0:19:00.49,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.07,0:19:02.16,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.03,0:19:05.45,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I know I did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:12.50,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:14.59,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Even so, I'm lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:20.18,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I may never be able to look him in the eye after we get back from summer vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:24.35,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,He may never smile and say, "Good morning," to me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.93,0:19:26.89,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,He may start to avoid me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:30.23,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I thought I was used to all these things by now, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.06,0:19:36.36,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,The last few days of my life have\N been so wonderful; I forgot all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:42.32,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,About the way I was before I met Kazehaya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.70,0:19:47.45,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I've already forgotten...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.41,0:19:51.37,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:54.42,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's summer break already...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.79,0:19:57.21,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,They said you were the shadow MVP.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.96,0:20:01.22,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}Sorry Sadako! Forgive us!\N--Your Classmates
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.67,0:20:01.22,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Everyone apologized.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.55,0:20:07.22,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,The misunderstanding was cleared up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.72,0:20:13.06,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,You stood up for me, and then you\N came all this way to give this to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.06,0:20:14.81,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,And you're still willing to talk to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:16.65,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I really appreciate it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.65,0:20:17.61,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:22.99,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I have a feeling you don't really understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:24.99,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.41,0:20:27.95,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel, Kazehaya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.95,0:20:28.91,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,No, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.67,0:20:36.84,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Is it all right if I expect...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:40.21,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,...that we'll see each other over the summer, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.05,0:20:44.97,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.09,0:20:47.85,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,U-Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.39,0:20:53.14,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,If you're looking for Kitahoro High, it's that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.10,0:20:55.19,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.61,0:21:03.99,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,That feeling I felt back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.74,0:21:08.49,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,This feeling, which has since then continued to grow...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:13.71,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I wonder if it'll reach you someday.
